@startuml sequence-login
title Session login
participant "User / browser" as P0
participant "core.views.user_login" as P1
participant "Django auth / session" as P2
database "SQLite" as P3
P0 -> P1 : POST /login/ (username, password)
P1 -> P3 : Read known user and LoginAttempt
P3 --> P1 : Account / lockout state
P1 -> P2 : If unlocked: validate credentials
P2 -> P3 : Read password hash; verify with configured hasher
P1 -> P3 : Valid: reset attempts; audit success
P1 -> P2 : Valid: login(request, user); create session
P1 --> P0 : Valid: 302 redirect / + session cookie
P1 -> P3 : Invalid: record failure; lock for 15 min at 5 attempts
P1 --> P0 : Invalid / locked: render login form with errors
@enduml
